Hmmmm... interesting idea. The best way to implement it would be probably
via a mechanism similar to praying - i.e. no special item is needed, but you
have to be in good standing with your God, you get a long prayer timeout,
and there's some global limit on how often you can invoke it.
And, of course, one has to be very careful about the list of items obtainable
by this mechanism. One could even add some 'trading' mechanism here - i.e. 
require that you give some of your magic items in exchange to balance it
further.
